OL,3,GNEWSARare butterfly spotted in Cornwall
OL,4,
OL,5,FA rare continental butterfly has been
OL,6,Fspotted in Cornwall as warmer weather
OL,7,Fdraws more migrant species to the UK,
OL,8,Fan attraction says.
OL,10,FThe Queen of Spain fritillary was
OL,11,Fspotted at the Eden Project in what was
OL,12,Fbelieved to be one of only a handful of
OL,13,Fsightings recorded in England this
OL,14,Fyear, staff said.
OL,16,FSix-year-old Lola noticed the insect in
OL,17,Fthe Outdoor Gardens and the sighting
OL,18,Fhad since been verified by the Cornwall
OL,19,FCounty recorder at Natural England,
OL,20,Fthey added.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
